Custom Sorting is used to sort the objects or items in custom manner like we can sort the objects on the basis of their names, 
their Integer value, date of modification, popularity, rating as we can do in e-commerce applications to sort the objects as per our 
convenience. 
For custom Sorting, the class needs to implement the Comparator interface. 
We define sorting logic in different classes like,
• one class for sorting by Names.
• second class for sorting by Amount.
• third class for sorting by any other parameter.

then we need to create an object of one of these classes and pass its reference in the TreeSet constructor. 
Now the sorting will be done on the basis of the custom class whose object is passed to the TreeSet. 
